    "title": "How to Get Masters 2027 Tickets: Lottery, Prices, and Schedule - Augusta Today",
    "text": "Got story updates? Submit your updates here. ›A cubist interpretation of the legendary Augusta National course and the storied Masters tournament captures the geometric complexity and visual drama of this iconic golfing event.Augusta TodayThe Masters golf tournament at Augusta National is one of the most exclusive sporting events in the world, with a 20-day ticket lottery being the only way for fans to secure a chance at attending. This article provides a comprehensive guide on the process for buying Masters 2027 tickets, including details on the lottery dates, ticket prices, the tournament schedule, and the history of the iconic Augusta National course. Why it matters The Masters is considered one of the premier events in professional golf, attracting the top players in the world and a global audience. Securing tickets is notoriously difficult, making this information valuable for any golf fan hoping to witness the tournament in person. The details The Masters 2027 ticket lottery will run for 20 days, from January 1-20, 2027. Fans can enter the lottery through the tournament's official website for a chance to purchase tickets. Prices for 2027 have not yet been announced, but in recent years daily tournament tickets have ranged from $115-$375, with practice round tickets costing $75. The 2027 Masters is scheduled to take place April 10-13, with the traditional Thursday-Sunday tournament rounds. Augusta National Golf Club, home of the Masters, is a par-72 course that measures 7,435 yards and is renowned for its pristine conditions and iconic holes like Amen Corner. The Masters 2027 ticket lottery will run from January 1-20, 2027.The 2027 Masters tournament is scheduled for April 10-13. The players Augusta National Golf ClubThe private golf club that hosts the annual Masters Tournament, known for its pristine course conditions and iconic holes like Amen Corner. Got photos? Submit your photos here. › What’s next Fans interested in attending the 2027 Masters can enter the ticket lottery through the tournament's official website when it opens on January 1, 2027. The takeaway The Masters is one of the most exclusive sporting events in the world, with a highly competitive ticket lottery being the only way for fans to secure a chance at attending this iconic golf tournament at Augusta National.",
